  "ingredients": [
    "2 medium poblano pepper",
    "1/2 medium cauliflower (florets)",
    "2 1/2 cup vegetable broth",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1/4 cup onion (diced)",
    "1/4 cup sour cream",
    "18 tablespoon cheddar cheese (shredded)",
    "1 tablespoon garlic powder",
    "1 teaspoon smoked paprika",
    "1 teaspoon cumin"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Set the broiler to high and arrange the poblano peppers on a baking sheet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast, turning occasionally for even cooking, until the skins are dark and the peppers are tender.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place peppers in a container with a lid and seal to cool. Set aside while you prepare the soup base.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Steam cauliflower florets on the stove top or in a silicone steamer case until very tender. Approximately 5 minutes in the microwave or 7-10 on the stove top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a high-speed blender or food processor, puree steamed cauliflower and 1 cup broth. Drizzle in the remaining broth and continue to puree until the mixture is a smooth consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat butter and onion over medium heat in a soup pot and cook until the onion is translucent.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add half the cauliflower puree, sour cream, and cheese to the pot and stir until thickened. Reduce to low heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the skin and seeds from the cooled poblano peppers and dice, reserving some garnish the finished soup.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the remaining cauliflower puree and diced peppers into the soup pot. Return heat to medium and simmer for about 5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the garlic powder, smoked paprika and cumin and remove from heat. Serve hot and top with reserved peppers and optional shredded cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/roasted-poblano-cheddar-soup/#wprm-recipe-52393-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
