        "reviewRating": {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "ratingValue": "4"
        },
        "reviewBody": "Made this last night and it was good - I had trouble getting the cauliflower puree smooth, even with an immersion blender.  The final product had more of a \"grit\" consistency. I added a little salt and more cheddar cheese to get the flavor just right.  I'd like to try it again before I give up on this one, cause it really did taste good!",
